@baseUrl = https://localhost:7000/api

### Technician: load active symptoms for a device type
GET {{baseUrl}}/diagnosis-symptoms?deviceType=Phone
Authorization: Bearer {{technicianToken}}

### Admin: load all symptoms
GET {{baseUrl}}/diagnosis-symptoms/admin
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Admin: create symptom
POST {{baseUrl}}/diagnosis-symptoms
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Cổng sạc lỏng",
  "deviceType": "Phone",
  "sortOrder": 99
}

### Admin: update symptom
PUT {{baseUrl}}/diagnosis-symptoms/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Cổng sạc lỏng/chập chờn",
  "deviceType": "Phone",
  "sortOrder": 99
}

### Admin: activate/deactivate symptom
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/diagnosis-symptoms/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/active
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isActive": false
}
